'''Sister Act''' (アイドル志望, ''Aidoru Shibō'', '''Idol Aspiring''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

